<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: A Death At Hooters
</h4>

<p>
I loved this story because it made me think.  It made me think about Hooters, the restaurant,  and the message it sends. It made me think about hooters and the irony of a woman waiting 10 months to find out if she had breast cancer. It made me think about Hooters girls as women making a living. It made me sad.
